    "title": "Petition calls for resignation of board member over controversial event attendance - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Megan Spector ,\n2 hours ago PHOENIX - A board member with the Phoenix Union High School District is under fire as a petition circulates calling for his resignation. The petition is calling for Jeremiah Cota to step down after he attended an event that is sparking concerns about his political beliefs and ties. Those pushing the petition want him out of his seat. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
